{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 19, :comments ["The sense of <b>and he shall make her swear</b>: that the woman shall answer amen, amen." "<b>if no man has lain with you.</b> The sense: another man, by force." "<b>and if you have not gone astray.</b> Willingly. And the precision of שטית is impurity, like לא תבנה אתהן גזית (you shall not build them of hewn stone)." "<b>clear.</b> She shall be clear, like ומות בהר (and you shall die on the mountain). And it is possible that the first oath is in the name [YHWH] and the second in אלה, as is explicit."], :book :numbers, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 5, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:16:26.261971852Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}